    "detailed_description": "Sausage Legend is a 3D physics-based fighting game where over 3 million players have clashed their sausages in battle.<br>The PC version has significantly enhanced graphics and a more immersive world. <br>Enjoy this crazy world with 3D cutscenes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959830/extras/a7df757ea18191912e9823d5af61df95.poster.avif?t=1732986956\" width=618 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959830/extras/a7df757ea18191912e9823d5af61df95.webm?t=1732986956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959830/extras/a7df757ea18191912e9823d5af61df95.mp4?t=1732986956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As a medieval prisoner, you will fight for your life in the &quot;Sausage Duel,&quot; a pastime of the nobility.<br>To gain your freedom, you must emerge victorious in this insane duel.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play 2v2 mode with your friends</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959830/extras/62043e4ffac99b948ca2684516335ebe.poster.avif?t=1732986956\" width=620 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959830/extras/62043e4ffac99b948ca2684516335ebe.webm?t=1732986956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2959830/extras/62043e4ffac99b948ca2684516335ebe.mp4?t=1732986956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Game Features<br>Physics-based Sausage Battles: Experience realistic physics as you engage in sausage combat.<br>Over 50 Types of Sausages: Includes a variety of other food items, each with unique characteristics.<br>Captivating 3D Cutscenes: Immerse yourself in the game's eccentric world.<br>Strategic Deck Building: Build a deck with three sausages and plan your strategy.<br>Friend and Online Battles: Challenge your friends or compete against players worldwide.",
